{"id":"vod_sn_38141","vodId":"38141","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"元气囝仔","name_cn":"元气囝仔","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/48f6ff06c3cc385965b59d37b8b9d1b3.jpg"},"summary":"半田清舟（小野大辅 配音）是一位书道家，年纪轻轻就已经获得了业界的认可和好评，一次意外中，他出手狠揍了一位开口批评他的老者，没想到这位其貌不扬的老人竟然是书道展览馆的馆长，清舟的父亲狠狠教训了嚣张跋扈的儿子，并且将他放逐到了自己曾经修行过的五岛，希望清舟在那里能够重新找回初心。　　刚开始，岛上闲散的慢节奏生活让清舟浑身不自在，但随着时间的推移，一干天真淳朴的岛民逐渐让清舟找到了自己人生的意义。活泼开朗的七岁小女孩奈瑠（原凉子 配音），个性大大咧咧的初中生山村美和（古木望 配音），金发不良少年木户浩志（内山昂辉 配音），在这些可爱孩子们的陪伴下，清舟的每一天都充满了未知和欢乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:58:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ndM2AmPMeu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y5ZVS44QL31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kk7nNGWiLF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xuaUE75XKK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zPk2u1DpPF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e8eZBmPDHB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HyJJpEwmgV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dHx6QCRBdf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pNGzuA7tsb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gFdV3zCkej1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uHbE6NJBe41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bpMxXdbsdL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ktYsJeJPRm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EgVfJq3rph1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1